WEBVTT

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:01.900
I'm interested to know

00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:03.540
what a creator's role is on Pinterest.

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:05.700
Is it like other social media,

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:07.600
like Instagram, where you show off

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:09.480
your lifestyle and what you're thinking?

00:00:09.620 --> 00:00:11.320
How do creators work?

00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:14.400
Yeah, it's probably a bit different.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:17.500
We like to say it's not

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:20.680
personalities delivering content,

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:22.060
it's content with personality.

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:25.300
So it's creators in the true sense:

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:28.600
they develop ideas, they create things,

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:31.840
and they show how to do it.

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:35.320
Think of Emma Chamberlain, who we partner with.

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:37.700
She's truly a creative person

00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:40.060
who builds partnerships and brands.

00:00:40.060 --> 00:00:44.140
Those creators do very well on Pinterest.

00:00:44.380 --> 00:00:46.440
And it's not about how many followers you have.

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:49.800
It's about how often your board gets saved.

00:00:49.960 --> 00:00:52.300
So: is the content I'm creating

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:54.600
spreading and getting more popular?

00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:57.960
It's not so much about the personal brand, right?

00:00:58.020 --> 00:00:59.060
It's really about their content.

00:00:59.840 --> 00:01:01.400
Now you've said that, it makes a ton of sense.

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.000
Because on other platforms it's about their life,

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:06.620
what they're doing and what they're wearing.

00:01:06.760 --> 00:01:08.540
Whereas this is about what they've created.

00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:09.140
Absolutely.

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:10.800
And there's a board behind everything.

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:13.600
There's a Pinterest board behind so many things.

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:16.260
It's such a great platform for true creators.

